  "summary": "<p><strong>Stealthing Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill establishes a civil action for the nonconsensual removal of a sexual protection barrier (e.g., a condom). A person may recover compensatory and punitive damages, injunctive and declaratory relief, and such other relief as a court may deem appropriate.</p>",
